<title>PERU: Peru's Backus y Johnston 11-mo net falls.</title>
<headline>Peru's Backus y Johnston 11-mo net falls.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ending November 30.</p>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 68.4 million soles vs 108.2 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 525.1 million soles vs 492.4 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Results only for Cerveceria Backus y Johnston SA.</p>
<p>Backus group shareholders merged December 30 Cerveceria Backus y Johnston SA -- Peru's largest brewery -- with its three sister companies Compania Nacional de Cerveza SA, Sociedad Cervecera de Trujillo SA and Cerveceria del Norte SA.</p>
<p>-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
